{"ID":"20240221144836-rutoq7f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20240221144836-rutoq7f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221144836-rutoq7f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221144859-yu47f2u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221144856-av2ksgy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5305,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221144856-av2ksgy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"方便法门","type":"doc","updated":"20240410075558"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240221144859-yu47f2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144859-yu47f2u","updated":"20240226091257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、脸部中风：桂枝加葛根汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240221144859-ue7umz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144859-ue7umz6","updated":"20240226104351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"b strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、解酒处方：苍术+泽泻；"}]},{"ID":"20240226104351-2rz2ilq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240226104351-2rz2ilq","updated":"20240227092706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、脚抽筋、静脉曲张、静脉瘤、心脏病：芍药甘草汤（也可预防心脏病，可加味附子）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227085759-zx3edho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227085759-zx3edho","updated":"20240227105606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、葛根汤：温病；脑膜炎（角弓反张，人往后仰）；小孩长水痘（使用葛根汤可能会长更多水痘，代表里面的水痘透发出来，属于正常现象，等气收回就自动好了）；面部中风（葛根加重）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227101440-08x116j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227101440-08x116j","updated":"20240227104049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、鼻窦炎：葛根汤加味白术附子（清涕）；葛根汤加味白术黄芩（浊涕）；"}]},{"ID":"20240221144900-0zbb7xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144900-0zbb7xi","updated":"20240227104417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、痛风：甘草附子汤+桂枝+白术+炮附子；"}]},{"ID":"20240227104417-om1a2gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227104417-om1a2gv","updated":"20240227104458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6.1、视频文字稿：比如来一个人，痛风，脚膝关节红肿的很大很痛，张仲景讲了热在表，骨髓里寒的。这个有时候痛左脚，有时候痛右脚，跑来跑去，风的性就是跑来跑去。所以我们去风的同时又祛风跟去寒，祛风的话桂枝，去湿的话白术，去寒的话炮附子。这三味药，我们把它配一起，经方里面很有名的甘草附子汤，专门治疗痛风的。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144900-xwthvd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144900-xwthvd0","updated":"20240227112022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、术附汤（排脓汤）：皮肤有脓、身体深处有脓；"}]},{"ID":"20240227112136-k2qy5mf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227112136-k2qy5mf","updated":"20240227112200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.1、赤豆当归散（排脓汤）：跟术附汤不同，专门排的是痔疮的脓；"}]},{"ID":"20240227112201-bc24qbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227112201-bc24qbh","updated":"20240227112616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7.2、如果遇到一个病人，脚破个洞化脓，因为糖尿病不能收口，偏偏又得到个葛根汤症，怎么办，还是给他吃葛根汤，你知道在脚上，除了加术附以外把白芍加倍，白芍加倍让他血液循环回来，把血拉回来，新的血会弥补上去。同时再排脓，处方就出来了。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144900-y4ye3yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144900-y4ye3yf","updated":"20240227142837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、肺结核：单吃一味杏仁，久服则愈之；"}]},{"ID":"20240227142829-u1w14db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227142829-u1w14db","updated":"20240227155538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9、大青龙发汗太过，温粉扑之：牡蛎、龙骨(马骨）、糯米,三味磨粉等量，扑在身上，汗就会止掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240227112618-1o9yqyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227112618-1o9yqyj","updated":"20240227183745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10、身体时而冒汗：桂枝汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240227183746-hmueicg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227183746-hmueicg","updated":"20240227191340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、冻疮：当归四逆汤内服+附子干姜粉外敷；"}]},{"ID":"20240227191341-obvl7ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227191341-obvl7ek","updated":"20240228095842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12、排气（放屁）多：厚朴生姜半夏甘草人参汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240228095843-034hfcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228095843-034hfcq","updated":"20240228165727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"13、头昏：苓桂术甘汤（起则头眩，站起来就头昏或动就会头昏晕眩）；真武汤（寒湿，头重脚轻）；"}]},{"ID":"20240227112618-2czr5b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240227112618-2czr5b1","updated":"20240228110125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"14、四逆、手脚冰冷：四逆汤；茯苓四逆汤（兼有烦躁）；四逆汤加人参（口干、失津）；"}]},{"ID":"20240221144900-833uwjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144900-833uwjp","updated":"20240228110603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"15、艾滋病，口渴，热，舌头如条纹状：白虎汤（阳明无死症）；"}]},{"ID":"20240228105513-u2r8wqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228105513-u2r8wqf","updated":"20240228141357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"16、渴欲饮水，喝水想吐：五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20240228141311-6cqgym6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228141311-6cqgym6","updated":"20240228152142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"17、吃什么都吐：半夏苦酒汤（对症，不会吐）；"}]},{"ID":"20240228141654-c3p42b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228141654-c3p42b6","updated":"20240228151556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"18、女人害喜呕吐\\妊辰怀孕呕吐：生姜+半夏+人参；"}]},{"ID":"20240228151445-jtgv4ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228151445-jtgv4ur","updated":"20240314154717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19、下痢\\下利：葛芩连汤（热痢，臭）；四逆汤（寒痢，下痢清谷，食物未消化）；桂枝人参汤（寒痢）；甘草泻心汤（寒痢）；理中汤（寒痢）；赤石脂禹馀粮汤（止涩）；黄芩汤（下痢、腹痛）；黄芩加半夏生姜汤方（下痢、腹痛、恶心）；大承气汤（便秘导致的下痢不止）；乌梅丸（紧张导致的下痢，如一考试就下痢）；白头翁汤（热利）；"}]},{"ID":"20240305150525-sch6ety","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305150525-sch6ety","updated":"20240305150527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19.1、当你治下痢的时候，利不止，用收敛的药，涩剂，祛湿的药也用了，消炎的药也用了，还是下痢，最后一条路利小便，把大肠的水利到膀胱里去，小便排出来，利就止掉了。如果没有办法止痢的时候，痢小便。利小便有很多处方，五苓散、猪苓汤可以利小便。甚至说本来里面就有利，他是热利是葛芩连汤症，葛芩连下去了，好很多了，大便原来很臭，现在不臭了，还是有下痢，葛芩连汤里可以加一些猪苓茯苓，泽泻，一些利尿剂，张仲景的意思就在这里面，车前子也可以，车前子利尿。经方做基础。"}]},{"ID":"20240314154607-o2qlqie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314154607-o2qlqie","updated":"20240314154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19.2、伤寒论有好几个地方出现热利，第一个葛芩连汤的时候有热利，但是葛芩连汤一定是有表症。第二个热利黄芩汤，黄芩汤的热利一定有肚痛。第三个黄连汤热利，黄连汤是寒热并结的，有寒有热的。这个白头翁汤也是纯热利，大便拉出来十几次，肛门很痛，里急很痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240314154719-nqgioa0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314154719-nqgioa0","updated":"20240314154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"19.3、热利的主证：一：手脚不寒；二：便臭；三：脉数,数代表热代表发炎了；"}]},{"ID":"20240228151840-ewk7yvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228151840-ewk7yvm","updated":"20240228165719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"20、中湿之人（湿很盛的人）、动不动就流汗、肌肉膶动：真武汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240228165056-60ddqel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228165056-60ddqel","updated":"20240228170543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"21、小孩子感冒发烧喉咙痛：葛根汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240228170453-f5f13nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228170453-f5f13nj","updated":"20240228170926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"22、皮肤病，有化脓的疮：小柴胡汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240228170926-sq26gjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228170926-sq26gjh","updated":"20240229092018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23、淋巴结、淋巴癌：小柴胡汤（加味硫磺效果更佳，头部脑部有积水可加重半夏）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229092109-j3scza0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229092109-j3scza0","updated":"20240229092119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"23.1、小柴胡汤方加减法：若胸中烦而不呕,去半夏、人参,加栝蒌实一枚。若渴者,去半夏,加人参合前成四两半,栝蒌四两。若腹中痛者,去黄芩,加芍药三两。若胁下痞鞕,去大枣,加牡蛎四两。若心下悸,小便不利者,去黄芩,加茯苓四两。若不渴外有微热者,去人参,加桂枝三两,温覆取微汗愈。若咳者,去人参、大枣、生姜,加五味子半升,干姜三两。"}]},{"ID":"20240229091702-gmtoskc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229091702-gmtoskc","updated":"20240229092233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24、当女人月经来时得到感冒：不管太阳中风、伤寒、温病，你要你月经来得到感冒一律小柴胡汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240229092241-ph3sc2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229092241-ph3sc2d","updated":"20240229092252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"24.1、经痛，肚子痛用白芍，胸满用枳实。白芍加重，加重到五钱、一两，看她痛到什么程度。"}]},{"ID":"20240229092500-o65emcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229092500-o65emcv","updated":"20240229092507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"25、甲状腺肿大：小柴胡汤加减；"}]},{"ID":"20240229092508-lbn8ofq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229092508-lbn8ofq","updated":"20240311092904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26、大肠癌：笼统来说不是承气汤就是大柴胡汤（未被西医开刀动过的情况下，如开刀大肠癌转肝癌，阳明进入厥阴证）；桃花汤（少阴病，血便混合）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229103801-jbbvs7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229103801-jbbvs7d","updated":"20240229103910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"26.1、医案例子：大黄牡丹皮汤症，把你当盲肠炎来治疗，同时薏仁附子败酱散，复方在里面。吃了大便开始排了。排到肿块没了，然后一直吃大柴胡汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240228105513-fa3b3k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228105513-fa3b3k6","updated":"20240229100132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"27、肚子痛：小建中汤（虚寒的痛）；"}]},{"ID":"20240228105513-ecqxsii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240228105513-ecqxsii","updated":"20240306111552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28、盲肠炎（足三里下一寸阑尾穴有压痛）：大黄牡丹皮汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240306111847-zsefrsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306111847-zsefrsq","updated":"20240306112543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.1、盲肠炎导致的盲肠破裂，痛感消失，盲肠位置皮肤发烫，变成腹膜炎，不动不痛，一动就痛：当归赤豆散（一要用发芽的赤小豆）；"}]},{"ID":"20240306115035-qjt82nb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306115035-qjt82nb","updated":"20240306115238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"28.2、拓展：大肠头、盲肠位置堵到，压痛，右下腹隐隐作痛（这一块破裂堵到的时候，手上左手的生命线有一个开心果那么大的紫斑）：薏苡附子败酱散；"}]},{"ID":"20240229103719-2ao44t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229103719-2ao44t5","updated":"20240301090016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29、腹部、膀胱有淤血（血结下焦）：桃核承气汤（小便不利，病人如狂）；抵挡汤（小便利，病人发狂）；"}]},{"ID":"20240301090005-uqwqo1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301090005-uqwqo1d","updated":"20240301090047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.1、水结下焦，小便不利：五苓散；"}]},{"ID":"20240301090025-1z71bw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301090025-1z71bw3","updated":"20240301090124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"29.2、水血两结，小便难,少腹满如墩状：大黄甘遂汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240229145200-ore836r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229145200-ore836r","updated":"20240229145226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"30、遗精：龙骨牡蛎汤（龙骨加重）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229145210-nd9vdq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229145210-nd9vdq9","updated":"20240229145230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"31、尿床：龙骨牡蛎汤（牡蛎加重）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229103707-qn6q0re","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229103707-qn6q0re","updated":"20240229152737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"32、肺精液不足：麦门冬汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240229152737-wudda1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229152737-wudda1m","updated":"20240229155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"33、烫伤、起卧不安，焦虑，惊狂：：桂枝去芍药加蜀漆龙骨牡蛎救逆汤；牡蛎打粉,加麻油，硫磺、大黄（外敷）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229154505-u60zjk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229154505-u60zjk7","updated":"20240229161455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"34、奔豚：桂枝加桂汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240229161456-wpdrz12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229161456-wpdrz12","updated":"20240229163042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"35、甲状腺亢进、甲状腺肿大：桂苓甘草龙骨牡蛎汤加减方；"}]},{"ID":"20240229163043-cm1vno9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229163043-cm1vno9","updated":"20240229163556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"36、扁桃腺发炎、喉咙痛：桂枝汤加葛根，可加味连翘清热，银花、浮萍、蝉兑；"}]},{"ID":"20240229103707-elbo3lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229103707-elbo3lz","updated":"20240306105653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"37、朝食暮吐：吴茱萸汤（虚症；里虚，严重者生姜换干姜）；大黄甘草汤（实症，）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229171743-pcc60we","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229171743-pcc60we","updated":"20240229172227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"38、吐，口不能食：大半夏汤（症状较浅）；吴茱萸汤；（烦逆、烧心、胃酸）；旋覆花代赭石汤（较重，嗝气）；"}]},{"ID":"20240229103707-vtde7qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229103707-vtde7qt","updated":"20240311161250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"39、胃下垂：吴茱萸汤（胃寒胃酸）；当归四逆加吴茱萸生姜汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240229172307-erq7zpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229172307-erq7zpp","updated":"20240301083010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"40、酒客不喜甘，湿热：吴茱萸汤加苍术5，泽泻6。"}]},{"ID":"20240229172256-a630fdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229172256-a630fdq","updated":"20240301083715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"41、酒局千杯不醉方：小柴胡汤半夏加重再加味泽泻、茯苓，喝酒前一小时喝，酒从尿解；"}]},{"ID":"20240229172256-5qy3pvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229172256-5qy3pvh","updated":"20240301085307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"42、怀孕时腹部有肿瘤：古时案例，妇人怀孕，子宫有肿瘤，肿瘤和胎儿一起长，压迫小孩子长不大，抵当汤下去，淤血排出去，肿块消除，小孩子就长大；"}]},{"ID":"20240301085308-i3u6kc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301085308-i3u6kc4","updated":"20240301094330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"43、干血劳、小腿一段肌肤假错：抵挡汤去大黄加地黄；大黄蟅虫丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240301094331-jfl14gy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240301094331-jfl14gy","updated":"20240304090708"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"44、胸前鼓起一块，西医可能诊断为肺炎、肺积水、肺脓疡：大陷胸丸；"}]},{"ID":"20240304102549-75nx0rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304102549-75nx0rg","updated":"20240304102558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"45、热实结胸：大陷胸汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240304142615-mdl1bwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304142615-mdl1bwc","updated":"20240304142617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"46、巴豆除了三物小白散，六种的使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-lphicf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-lphicf6","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（一）巴豆、桔梗等量同用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",巴豆一颗或两颗,专门使毒化成脓,有的时候身体里面的结毒、硬块、痞块在身体里面很深的地方,发不出来,要让它化成脓排出来：例如肺中的脓疡属寒实者。巴豆跟桔梗等量在用的时候，巴豆跟桔梗在一起一定是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用在肺上面的脓疡，很深排不出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们会使用它。巴豆用的地方一定是寒症，寒实结到了。热实不可以用巴豆，因为巴豆是很热的药。如果你把巴豆里面的油提炼出来，变成一颗颗豆子，就是现在的咖啡豆，咖啡豆跟巴豆是一样。所以咖啡不要喝。他们也知道咖啡里面的油是有毒的，他把油脂提炼掉变成干的，所以你拿到咖啡豆是巴豆碳。这种毒药的东西很香，味道很重。巴豆深部的脓、寒实在里面，都可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-zp4r70t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-zp4r70t","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人被西医判断肺癌。病人晚上三点到五点失眠，如果是寒实，你才可以用，去掉以后，这段时间还是不可以睡，代表没有效，如果吃了以后睡过去了，代表有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-rrmkmdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-rrmkmdr","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（二）巴豆和贝母同用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":","},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"专门去喉咙、咽喉之堵塞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",癌症到末期的时候,比如喉癌，东西都没有办法吞下去,这通关利结的力量很强。如果光巴豆跟贝母，贝母也去痰，但是贝母去的痰跟桔梗的不一样，桔梗是在肺里面，贝母去的痰是喉咙的部分。所以川贝枇杷膏专门去喉咙的痰。经方在使用的时候，开喉结的时候，一般来说只是痰或食物梗到，不是癌症人，半夏苦酒汤就可以治疗。再严重点可以用硝石，就是炸药，可以打开它。还有巴豆和贝母可以让喉咙打开，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"通关利结没有比它效果更强了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果化疗开刀的，效果就没有了，如果没有化疗开刀，就是喉癌，整个梗到了，这个巴豆和贝母。你不敢用太凶了，那你要病人死还是用？当然用了，但是如果病人做过开刀化疗，再肿回来的，效果就不好了，下手都没有效了，所以我一直在呼吁大家不要做（不要被西医处理）。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-os98iyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-os98iyr","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"轻症用半夏苦酒汤、严重的用硝石,或用经方中的巴豆和贝母。但是如果是西医开刀或化疗过的病人,再肿起来的,用了就效果不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-s9vmi7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-s9vmi7d","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（三）巴豆、杏仁同用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",叫「走马汤」,马一边走一边大便，意思就是说，这两个药吃下去就跟马一样，到处大便，忍都忍不住。巴豆、杏仁同用，是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用在心胸的结毒,"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肠胃里面如果说有食物坏死在里面，病人或者有胶痰，梗在胸腔肺的地方，再加上坏死的食物，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"食物在大肠胃小肠里面，肠胃整个堵到，再加上胸腔里面有痰的时候，这个走马汤很厉害。心胸结毒的时候，非常的痛，拒按，病人会跟你说非常的痛，吃东西吃不下，吃了又吐出来，里面就是梗到了。大便又排不出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个时候用走马汤。走马汤使用的时候，比如说巴豆三颗，杏仁十颗、十二颗都没有关系。这个不煮的，生用的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你把巴豆的壳剥掉，里面的芯拿掉，光是巴豆的仁，仁是黄白色的。跟杏仁放在一起，挤一挤，压一压，两个都有油，生的，用棉布包起来，加热水下去，你如果冷水下去，巴豆药性就没了，巴豆最怕冷水，冷水就没有用了，热水下去沾湿了以后，一拧汁就出来了，再去泡一下，这样来回大概四次左右，剂量差不多是一汤匙的量。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个一剂下去，从食道到肛门，统统出去了，没有东西可以挡他。但是这个是用到寒结到的时候，我们才会使用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-vz0vx9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-vz0vx9r","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（四）巴豆和大黄、干姜并用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",专门"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用在下腹结痛,肚子结痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时候，可能是大肠癌，或者是肿瘤，大便排不出来了，这个时候用巴豆打出来它。目前用在大肠癌的就是这味方剂,大肠癌到后期都不大便,癌细胞长满了,西医可能做个人工肛门,巴豆下去可以打个洞,看它多凶悍，有点腐蚀性的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用这药要有「必死的决心」"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",这是很危险的时候用。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-wwrve5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-wwrve5z","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（五)巴豆和炮附子、吴茱萸同用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",这个炮附子已经很凶了，再加上巴豆那么热的药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"专门治心胸寒痛,胃里面感觉冰凉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的,病人的陈述说胃里面有冰块在里面,一般我们常常用的干姜，附子热药下去，半天冰块还在那里，寒到如此之寒，实在没有办法了，可以用到巴豆，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不用五颗十颗，两颗就够了，胃热起来了，非常的凶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，加上炮附子能够去寒，吴茱萸能够止呕，恶心呕吐的时候常常会用到吴茱萸，但是是寒症的呕吐，再加上巴豆。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-pc1oukt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-pc1oukt","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（六）巴豆与芫花同用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",能"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去大腹积水与痞块积聚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果说腹水，肝病的病人水肿，一定要确定里面是寒实，热实你不要啊，热实很简单，有时候一发表，越婢汤水就排掉了，五苓散水就排掉了。寒实结到会使用到巴豆和芫花，巴豆和芫花是等量，芫花非常轻，所以当你拿两颗巴豆去秤可能是三分之一钱，芫花的三分之一钱一坨，芫花非常轻，就这两味药做成药丸。巴豆打碎油脂很多，芫花打碎和到一起就变成药丸，吃下去开始排水，水排的很快，痞块、硬块寒实的积聚统统可以用。只要确定是寒实。实都是拒按，硬块，里面是寒症。寒症病人口不渴，你只要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把不渴治成渴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就好了，寒变热，寒实会死，热症不会死。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-t5591dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-t5591dl","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用到巴豆,必须病人没有被西医处理过。"}]},{"ID":"20240304144233-3jjn19t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304144233-3jjn19t","updated":"20240304144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"处方到这个阶段是经方的极致"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。我们用生附子，硫磺还没有到极限，这才是极限。但是一再提醒诸位必须病人没有被西医碰过。如果开过刀，做过化疗，栓塞，肝栓塞，效果就不好，效果不好为什么我不敢用，因为你效果不好的话，你用巴豆，万一救不回来,病人不了解，病人说死在巴豆上面，实际上不是死在巴豆上，他忘记他得什么病了，很麻烦，所以下手的时候，我在处方下手的时候，最怕病人家属，有一个不相信我，我就不敢动手，就像越南那个胰脏癌的，我叫他不要喝，我开好处方了，第一次吃完的时候，第二次来的时候，他已经开始打嗝了，还有很好的药还没有用，他儿子在旁边问我要吃多久，中药要吃多久?你爸爸都快死了，还在问我中药吃多久，可能他只能活一个礼拜，两个礼拜，你还在问我中药要吃多久，代表你不相信中医，我手就不敢下，不敢下手他死掉了，一个礼拜就死掉了。可是另外一个美国人我救回来了，他一进来，说海夏，随便你怎么做，交给你，一家人统统赞成，硬把他救回来了，我已经救他两次了。"}]},{"ID":"20240229172256-kvtgx53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240229172256-kvtgx53","updated":"20240305102341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"47、肺积水：十枣汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240305102341-8qzxwl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305102341-8qzxwl1","updated":"20240305105617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"48、热气导致的如胃热上浮导致的眼睛流血、流鼻血、牙龈出血、鼻子出血：大黄黄连泻心汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240304142340-5hznyem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240304142340-5hznyem","updated":"20240305105914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"49、皮肤化脓没法收口：大黄黄连泻心汤方加白术、乳香、末药、三七打粉外敷；"}]},{"ID":"20240305105914-rntgrzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305105914-rntgrzg","updated":"20240305105954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"50、去胶痰：皂荚红枣汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240305105954-45ari2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305105954-45ari2c","updated":"20240305110231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51、戒烟涤痰方：皂荚三钱\t红枣适量\t痰多加天南星三钱"}]},{"ID":"20240305110232-iuf3uuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305110232-iuf3uuq","updated":"20240305110233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51.1、口不渴者加半夏、戒烟后胃口太盛加石膏一两以上、去肺中之湿气加知母五钱。如果戒烟以后失眠、烦躁,加柴胡三钱疏散肝郁以后,抽烟的欲望就少了。"}]},{"ID":"20240305110340-68s9qs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305110340-68s9qs0","updated":"20240305110355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51.2、文字稿：痰很多，有天南星。口不渴用半夏，口渴的话不用半夏。戒烟体胖，用石膏，看他体格，三四百磅的八两，个子小的用一两。石膏能够去胃热，石膏是寒凉的药一下去，胃蠕动就减缓，胃热就下降，胃口就下来了。知母能够去湿，把肺里面的湿收敛起来，再配合一些祛痰的药就能够把烟戒掉。老烟枪，不抽晚上睡不着，加些柴胡下去，里面有黄芩了，加些疏肝的药，比如说玉金。柴胡三钱，黄芩三钱，皂荚也是三钱，南星也是三钱，知母五钱，玉金可以用五钱疏肝气，这样肝脏功能起来的时候能够帮助解毒，他欲望就没有了。如果不开柴胡黄芩，玉金，你没有开清肝的药，光是开上面的药，会把肺里面的烟痰清干净，可是他还是会像抽烟。你加这些下去就不想抽烟了。按照这个方法不但可以戒掉烟，还可以瘦掉。"}]},{"ID":"20240305110527-drbg6dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305110527-drbg6dd","updated":"20240305110546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"51.3、十个戒烟九个胖，要想不胖，善用石膏；"}]},{"ID":"20240305150543-jdwgjja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305150543-jdwgjja","updated":"20240305162037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"52、腹痛、胃炎：黄连汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240305162037-yfjbqva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305162037-yfjbqva","updated":"20240305171338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"53、痛风：桂枝附子汤（身体烦疼）；桂枝附子去桂加白术汤（大便溏，小便自利）；附子甘草汤（骨节烦疼，知名痛风方）；"}]},{"ID":"20240305165915-h8nrjq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305165915-h8nrjq5","updated":"20240306093432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"54、胃中冷：理中汤；甘草干姜汤；吴茱萸汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240305110133-sw1uck2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240305110133-sw1uck2","updated":"20240306113040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55、肠间有水气：己椒苈黄丸+芒硝汤冲服；"}]},{"ID":"20240306112902-hre24xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306112902-hre24xl","updated":"20240306113033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"55.1、文字稿：妈妈回家，儿子躲到哪吓她，有的人是发奔豚，有的不是，大便梗到这边，大肠这边有一个血管，直接络到肝脏，一紧张，干燥的大便顶到血管这边来，当干燥大便顶到（肝脏）这边，有一个特殊的症状会出现，叫肠子中间有水气。病人便秘，这个地方痛，你压他肚子，一压咕噜咕噜水声很多，不是大承气，也不是小承气，这是受惊吓发的，用己椒苈黄丸，防己、椒目、葶苈子、大黄，做成丸剂，外面三钱的芒硝在汤里面，丸剂吞下去，芒硝汤冲下去，把这个大便打掉。一打掉整个大便大下。但是这个一定要用丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240306112903-ij93w3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306112903-ij93w3r","updated":"20240311083910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"56、便秘：麻子仁丸（大便如羊粪）；小承气汤（小肠堵到）；大承气汤（大肠堵到）；大黄附子细辛汤（寒实）；"}]},{"ID":"20240306152206-lzydsdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306152206-lzydsdq","updated":"20240306152214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"57、心中懊恼：栀子豉汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240306152214-cbmxs70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306152214-cbmxs70","updated":"20240311115858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"58、膀胱炎、尿道结石、肾结石：猪苓汤；茯苓戎盐汤（用青盐）；"}]},{"ID":"20240306152557-w5isik9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306152557-w5isik9","updated":"20240306152803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"59、渴欲饮水、小便不利：猪苓汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240306152804-78jda0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306152804-78jda0c","updated":"20240306153300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"60、结石：如果遇到结石的时候，在脚的内踝落，太溪穴到复溜穴会找到结石的压痛点，如果懂针灸，用手压到痛点，针扎到痛点的时候，痛就去掉，病人会感觉石头在动，一直在移动。再煮猪苓汤再攻，有时候用药丸丸剂也可以。"}]},{"ID":"20240306153303-rw5mitz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306153303-rw5mitz","updated":"20240306162944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"61、小孩子受惊：耳朵后面有鸡爪的血脉，刺刺放点血；"}]},{"ID":"20240306162944-k6q85wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306162944-k6q85wq","updated":"20240312145351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62、实症型肝腹水，脾脏肿大型腹水：分消汤——《万病回春》；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"详见文字稿第二百四十七条。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312100412-ce7a1cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312100412-ce7a1cp","updated":"20240312100455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"62.1、肝病末期，没办法的时候：补中治湿汤（一剂）；"}]},{"ID":"20240306112903-tpynpef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306112903-tpynpef","updated":"20240306184822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"63、虚症型肝腹水：补气建中汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"详见文字稿第二百四十七条。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240306172406-zxncbhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306172406-zxncbhi","updated":"20240306185109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"64、肾脏病水肿、肾脏积水：四神汤（白果可换淮山）加点龙眼肉，海盐，蔗糖，绿豆（如果是冬天，绿豆换成红豆），可以煮成稀饭吃；鲤鱼赤豆汤；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"详见文字稿第二百四十七条。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240306172206-mw2i0co","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306172206-mw2i0co","updated":"20240306193014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"65、急性肝炎：茵陈蒿汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240306172206-merqpq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306172206-merqpq4","updated":"20240307155948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"66、眼科发炎，角膜炎：栀子柏皮汤（外洗）；"}]},{"ID":"20240306193008-wjg9ife","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306193008-wjg9ife","updated":"20240307161929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"67、皮肤病：麻黄连翘赤小豆汤（疥疮、藓、疮等）；麻杏苡甘汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240307161853-zaz3yfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240307161853-zaz3yfx","updated":"20240308152300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68、血癌：桂枝汤重用芍药（桂枝加芍药汤），根据情况加味，脾湿肚子胀加生附子，胃口不好加白术、茯苓利湿；"}]},{"ID":"20240308152300-kb32zii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308152300-kb32zii","updated":"20240308152340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"68.1、怎么判断好了？阳恢复就好了。本来不能睡的可以睡了，不能吃的可以吃了，大小便不好的，正常了，手脚本来冰冷热起来了。背后第五椎压痛是诊断血癌的，第五椎按下不痛了，好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240306193008-j9ma1wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240306193008-j9ma1wk","updated":"20240311084131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"69、失眠：栀子豉汤；黄连阿胶汤（少阴，虚烦不得眠）；"}]},{"ID":"20240308152345-0986n46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308152345-0986n46","updated":"20240311103930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70、喉咙痛：苦酒汤或半夏苦酒汤（倪师常用于吞不下东西）；巴豆贝母制成糊状，吸管吸起来，喷在喉咙里，如喷错到舌头能烧出一个洞，可喝冷水解（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吞不下东西，严重者，此法效力是苦酒汤十几倍，迅猛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）；半夏散或半夏汤（倪师常用于吞得下东西）；"}]},{"ID":"20240409162726-idr4lsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240409162726-idr4lsr","updated":"20240409163155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"70.1、喉咙有东西哽住，吞不下去：半夏苦酒汤力道不够时，用利膈汤，条文出在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"笔记→倪海厦→金匮要略→视频同步文字→黄土汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240311101716-os21mf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311101716-os21mf6","updated":"20240311105152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"71、吃鱼骨头卡住：取同一条鱼的一根骨头，火烧焦黑，打碎变成灰，当药粉水冲下去，一阳一阴，一结合骨头就会掉下去，化掉了；"}]},{"ID":"20240308152345-77zxw6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308152345-77zxw6o","updated":"20240311105552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72、闪到腰：童子尿；"}]},{"ID":"20240311105543-moc2cqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311105543-moc2cqy","updated":"20240311105601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"72.1、文字稿：我的老师，他的腰闪到，自己没有把法扎针，他找童子，弄一泡尿回来，喝下去大概二十分钟，他感觉腰的活力很强，腰的命门的地方一直在动，痛开始慢慢舒缓下来，热力慢慢扩散开来，就好了。他说童子尿很强，进到命门的地方，童子是纯阳的。"}]},{"ID":"20240311105516-g1gnwyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311105516-g1gnwyy","updated":"20240311114918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73、胆结石、胆发炎：四逆散；"}]},{"ID":"20240314154648-yr8is6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240314154648-yr8is6f","updated":"20240314154653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"73.1、胆结石的主证：一：在「阳陵泉」下一寸的「胆结石穴」有压痛点。二：痛起来的时候,胸痛彻到背后去,从胆的地方痛到肩膀上去。三：腹诊的时候,胆经的「曰月」会有压痛点。"}]},{"ID":"20240311114919-nj2nzha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311114919-nj2nzha","updated":"20240312100322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"74、糖尿病脚烂了要截肢或其他原因截肢或白带或慢性胃病或疝气：当归四逆汤；"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240311154630-d3n675n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311154630-d3n675n","updated":"20240311163320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"75、心下悸：桂枝甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240311163323-u2gpcsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311163323-u2gpcsg","updated":"20240311163333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"76、脐下悸：茯苓甘草汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240311105602-3sz4ass","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311105602-3sz4ass","updated":"20240311164452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"77、肝病吐血：麻黄升麻汤（胃癌、胃吐血不用这个方）；"}]},{"ID":"20240311164207-gt41zc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311164207-gt41zc5","updated":"20240311164513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"78、胃癌胃病吐血：黄土汤；"}]},{"ID":"20240311164513-6apwmye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311164513-6apwmye","updated":"20240311164919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"79、胰脏癌：干姜黄连黄芩人参汤；旋覆花代赭石汤加减，可加干姜吴茱萸各三钱，如果病人恶心、呕吐、胃酸很盛可用；"}]},{"ID":"20240311163741-ck7wvzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240311163741-ck7wvzg","updated":"20240312095509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"80、头痛：吴茱萸汤（印堂痛）；"}]},{"ID":"20240308152345-a2m575j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240308152345-a2m575j","updated":"20240314154440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"81、乳癌经验方"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-246dove","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-246dove","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是治乳癌或是乳房中有硬块,尚未溃烂破出时使用："}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-75extpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-75extpx","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱       "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱         "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五钱     "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"川芎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱       "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三七"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱     "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"续断"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱    "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五钱       "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳起石"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱     "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白芍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五钱"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱            "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱   "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炒麦芽"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五钱 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"玉金"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五钱    "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当归"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二钱"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一尔             "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"龙胆草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三钱"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-0cj5w1h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":6,"Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-0cj5w1h","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体力差足冷,加熟地三钱；经期加桂枝三钱。九碗水煮成三碗,早晚餐前各一碗"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-856ebzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-856ebzh","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"是治疗乳癌已经溃决破口,有恶臭,出黑臭水时使用:"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-4dxr73t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-4dxr73t","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三钱\t紫根五钱\t龙骨五钱\t牡蛎一两\t白朮五钱\n炮附子五钱\t黄芩三钱\t黄连三钱\t九碗水煮成三碗,早晚餐前各一碗"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-pr9we6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-pr9we6r","updated":"20240314154446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"82、判断淤血的方法"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-01zjbc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-01zjbc3","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（1）血会「膈俞」,病人一定会有「膈俞痛」,督脉第七椎外开一寸半,就是「膈俞穴」。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-ubbkqyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-ubbkqyl","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（2）舌有齿痕,舌头上有牙齿的痕迹,因为舌为心表,心主血,身上循环系统很好的时候,舌头会很光润,循环不好的时候,舌头的循环也会跟着不好,舌头跟牙齿贴到,一拉开来,牙齿印还在上面,就代表瘀血,很多都是妇科子宫的问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-qss3u6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-qss3u6t","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（3）「血海」痛,足太阴脾经上的「血海穴」会痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-4grul9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-4grul9u","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（4）「三阴交」,「三阴交」有压痛点,「三阴交痛」大多在妇科里面,「三阴交」主腹、少腹的地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-7i9perd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-7i9perd","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（5）更严重的,在肚子上看到一块一块的青紫。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-6tp1hzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-6tp1hzp","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（6）口渴而不欲饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-2aecne6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-2aecne6","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83、治胃癌汤方"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-yijmj0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-yijmj0k","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根    柴胡    半夏   甘草    白朮   茯苓"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-xklr9uz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-xklr9uz","updated":"20240221144856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"人参   大枣   干姜   生姜    加上金匮中的黄土汤加减就可以治胃癌"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-vg1ze5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-vg1ze5k","updated":"20240314154539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"83.1、这处方下去的时候,如果要加减,葛根重用至六钱,再来是柴胡五钱,半夏三钱,甘草二钱,白朮、茯苓等量五钱,家里钱多的人参就用多一点。如果下利得很厉害。红枣用十枚都没关系,干姜、生姜视状况各两钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-035lesv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-035lesv","updated":"20240410075554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"84、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"鼻炎方：辛夷菖蒲苍术汤（辛夷2钱菖蒲3钱苍术3钱），该方不论寒热皆可用，如考虑寒热，寒可加味干姜，热可加味杏仁，如有心脏问题，不加辛夷，重用菖蒲；麝香矾石散（无孔不入，钻通九窍）；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240221144856-av2ksgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221144856-av2ksgy","updated":"20240410075558"}}]}